  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview&#xA;Get data from input file, which is used in the subsequent Argument creation processes.&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_InputFilePath as path of input file &lt;String&gt;&#xA;out_InputDataSheet as Input Data Sheet &lt;Dictionary&lt;String,DataTable&gt;&gt;&#xA;out_SheetNames as Input Data Sheet Names &lt;List&lt;String&gt;&gt;" DisplayName="LoadExcelData" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_700">
